# built download artifact — regenerated by printer-agent's `npm run package` (Docker) or
# printer-agent/scripts/build-download-package.ps1 (native/non-Docker deploy)
client/public/downloads/*
# ...except the installer itself: Inno Setup (ISCC.exe) is Windows-only and can't run inside the
# Linux Docker build, so unlike the zip it can't be regenerated there — it's built on a Windows
# machine and committed. Rebuild + re-commit via `npm run installer` (printer-agent/) whenever
# printer-agent's source changes. See printer-agent/scripts/build-installer.ps1.
!client/public/downloads/trivo-print-agent-setup.exe

